    <sys:String x:Key="Str_ReliabilityGood">良好 (Good) - 假阳性率低，测试数据具备高可信度</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str_ReliabilityQuestionable">可疑 (Questionable) - 假阳性或 1000Hz 复测差异稍高</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str_ReliabilityPoor">不佳 (Poor) - 建议重新施测</sys:String>
